<title>GERMANY: SOCCER-BORUSSIA DORTMUND 1 MANCHESTER UNITED 0 - RESULT.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BORUSSIA DORTMUND 1 MANCHESTER UNITED 0 - RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>DORTMUND, Germany 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Borussia Dortmund of Germany beat Manchester United of England 1-0 (halftime 0-0) in their European Cup semifinal first leg on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Rene Tretschok 76</p>
<p>Attendance: 48,500</p>
